      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T04:41:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Won\u0027t this be always the case, since this can only get here if raw_reset_cause is either 2 or 3?\nIf so, this check is redundant, and you can just have:\n} else {\n   return WATCHDOG_RST;\n}",
      "revId": "f3d0ca3300e26eccd67f34dadadf48737c836c48",
