      "message": "I\u0027ve removed support for returning RESET_PIN and added a comment describing how #WRST and power-on can\u0027t be differentiated. Since the status quo was to indicate both power-on and reset-pin, indicating only power-on won\u0027t change the behavior of the flash driver or tc_state_init.",
